From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Holodor <holodor@local>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:40:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ir3/sched, tu: only block kill/demote on same-block bary.f
 and guard null shader variant

ir3_sched schedules one basic block at a time (`sched_block`), and
`sched_node_add_dep()` explicitly ignores cross-block dependencies
(`if (src->block != instr->block) return;`). However, `check_instr()`
iterated `ir->baryfs[]` across the entire shader without checking
`baryf->block != instr->block`.

In shaders where an early basic block executes `demote` / `kill` and a
subsequent basic block executes `bary.f` (such as Remedy Northlight's
MSAA/per-sample fragment shaders in Control Ultimate Edition,
`fs.3309d1dc1b1826cd252f1f105f3583a9`), the `bary.f` in the later block
can never be scheduled while scheduling the earlier block. This caused
`check_instr()` to permanently block the `demote` instruction, returning
`-1` from `ir3_sched()`, returning `NULL` from `ir3_shader_create_variant()`,
and triggering a NULL pointer dereference in `tu_shader_create()`.

Skip `bary.f` instructions from other basic blocks in `check_instr()` and
guard against `NULL` `shader->variant` in `tu_shader_create()`.
---
 src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_sched.c    | 2 ++
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_sched.c b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_sched.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_sched.c
+++ b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_sched.c
@@ -527,6 +527,8 @@ check_instr(struct ir3_sched_ctx *ctx, struct ir3_sched_notes *notes,
          struct ir3_instruction *baryf = ir->baryfs[i];
          if (baryf->flags & IR3_INSTR_UNUSED)
             continue;
+         if (baryf->block != instr->block)
+            continue;
          if (!is_scheduled(baryf)) {
             notes->blocked_kill = true;
             return false;
diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
@@ -3433,6 +3433,12 @@ tu_shader_create(struct tu_device *dev,
    shader->variant =
       ir3_shader_create_variant(ir3_shader, ir3_key, executable_info);
 
+   if (!shader->variant) {
+      ir3_shader_destroy(ir3_shader);
+      vk_free(&dev->vk.alloc, shader);
+      return VK_ERROR_OUT_OF_HOST_MEMORY;
+   }
+
    if (ir3_exceeds_safe_constlen(shader->variant)) {
       struct ir3_shader_key safe_constlen_key = *ir3_key;
       safe_constlen_key.safe_constlen = true;
-- 
